                    <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                            <div class="swiper-slide" hid="145">
                                <div class="card cardInsiderPicks">
                                    <div class="imgSlider">
                                        <script src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/7d0fa10a/cloudflare-static/rocket-loader.min.js" data-cf-settings="c2bca3f43ab1ff5e5dc0aa4e-|49"></script><img src="https://betamedia.experienceegypt.eg/media/experienceegypt/img/Original/2022/8/9/2022_8_9_0_56_39_490.jpeg" onerror="this.src='https://betamedia.experienceegypt.eg/media/experienceegypt/img/Medium/errorimg.png'" class="card-img-top img-fluid HoverScale"
                                             alt="img" loading="lazy">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                            <p class="card-text text-start titleHiddenCity">
                                                Take a stroll through the Antoniadis Villa and Gardens, built to resemble a miniature version of Versailles in France. The villa and lush gardens date back to the 19th century and were owned by Sir John Antoniadis. 
                                            </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide" hid="146">
                                <div class="card cardInsiderPicks">
                                    <div class="imgSlider">
                                        <script src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/7d0fa10a/cloudflare-static/rocket-loader.min.js" data-cf-settings="c2bca3f43ab1ff5e5dc0aa4e-|49"></script><img src="https://betamedia.experienceegypt.eg/media/experienceegypt/img/Original/2022/8/9/2022_8_9_0_56_53_942.jpeg" onerror="this.src='https://betamedia.experienceegypt.eg/media/experienceegypt/img/Medium/errorimg.png'" class="card-img-top img-fluid HoverScale"
                                             alt="img" loading="lazy">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                            <p class="card-text text-start titleHiddenCity">
                                                Visit the Cavafy Museum, which was once the apartment of renowned Greek-Alexandrian poet Constantine Cavafy (1863–1933). The small apartment is now a tribute to his life and his rich body of work with many of his documents and manuscripts on display.
                                            </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>


                    </div>
